Modified by Ferni: converted to ONNX with SpeechBrain's Fbank front end (STFT
written as an equivalent conv1d DFT) and sentence mean normalization inside the
graph, and an L2-normalized output (scripts/speaker/export-ecapa-onnx.py).

ECAPA-TDNN: B. Desplanques, J. Thienpondt, K. Demuynck, "ECAPA-TDNN: Emphasized
Channel Attention, Propagation and Aggregation in TDNN Based Speaker
Verification", Interspeech 2020.
SpeechBrain: M. Ravanelli et al., "SpeechBrain: A General-Purpose Speech
Toolkit", arXiv:2106.04624, 2021.
